  plain="Every car that passes a plate reader is logged. The Town gave Flock its address and parcel map data to host on Flock's servers. HOA boards shared their neighborhood cameras with police, and the Chief set alerts on cars entering private communities. A Flock employee was given a login to the Town's system. We found no notice to residents about any of this in these records, beyond agenda items at the advisory committee.",
